"""Built-in locale records used by `Locale`.

Locale data is derived from Arrow 1.4.0 (https://github.com/arrow-py/arrow),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0, with an Amharic correction for future
hours. Simplified and Traditional Chinese keep Morrow's 1.0 text. The record
field order is documented in locale.mojo; `\x1f` separates a key from its
text and `\x1e` separates items.
"""

comptime LOCALE_COUNT = 81
comptime LOCALE_ZH_CN = 77
comptime LOCALE_ZH_TW = 79


def _locale_index(name: String) -> Int:
